#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:278
msgid "Adds aria-label to quantity +/− buttons, the product gallery trigger link, and Add to Cart buttons on archive pages. Injects a JS live region for cart announcements and aria-current for variation selectors. WCAG 4.1.2 / 2.4.4."
