#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:356
msgid "Fix external links (target=\"_blank\")"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:357
msgid "Automatically adds a screen reader notice to every link that opens in a new browser tab. WCAG Technique G201 - Criterion 2.4.4."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:362
msgid "Inject Skip Link (Skip to content)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:363
msgid "Inserts an invisible link as the first element in <body>, allowing keyboard users to skip repeated navigation. WCAG Technique G1 - Criterion 2.4.1."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:368
msgid "Fix alt attribute on decorative images"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:369
msgid "Ensures images without alternative text explicitly receive alt=\"\" instead of no attribute, preventing screen readers from announcing the file name. WCAG Technique H67 - Criterion 1.1.1."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:374
msgid "Inject High-Contrast Focus CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:375
msgid "Adds a global CSS rule that ensures a visible, high-contrast focus indicator (3px solid #0056b3) on all interactive elements. WCAG Criterion 2.4.11."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:390
msgid "Menu Accessibility Helper (ARIA)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:391
msgid "Automatically adds aria-haspopup=\"true\" and aria-expanded=\"false/true\" to navigation links that open a sub-menu, with native JavaScript toggle management. WCAG Criterion 4.1.2."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:396
msgid "Heading Hierarchy Check (H1–H6)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:397
msgid "On post or page save, analyses the heading structure and shows an admin notice if a hierarchy skip is detected (e.g. H2 → H4) that disorients screen readers. WCAG Criteria 1.3.1 and Technique H42."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:402
msgid "Pre-Publish Accessibility Checklist (Gutenberg)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:403
msgid "Adds a panel to the Gutenberg pre-publish drawer that checks in real time: (A) images without alt text, (B) links using a raw URL as clickable text. WCAG Criteria 1.1.1 and 2.4.4."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:418
msgid "Fix nameless links (image & icon links)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:419
msgid "Adds aria-label to links whose only content is an image with empty alt or an SVG icon - common for sponsor logos, partner logos, and social icons. Label is derived from img title, link title, or recognised domain (YouTube, Facebook, etc.). WCAG Criteria 2.4.4 / 4.1.2."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:424
msgid "Fix untitled iframes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:425
msgid "Adds a descriptive title attribute to every <iframe> that has none. Titles are automatically matched from the src URL: YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, Calendly, iubenda, and more. Screen readers announce untitled iframes simply as \"frame\". WCAG Criterion 4.1.2."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:430
msgid "Fix unlabelled form inputs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:431
msgid "Adds aria-label to <input>, <textarea>, and <select> fields that have no associated <label> or aria-label attribute. The label is derived from the placeholder text or name attribute. Only fields with no existing accessible name are modified. WCAG Criteria 1.3.1 / 3.3.2."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:436
msgid "Fix nameless buttons (icon-only buttons)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:437
msgid "Adds aria-label to <button> elements that contain only an icon or an SVG, which screen readers otherwise announce as just \"button\". The label is derived from the purpose words in the button's own class or in its icon class - menu, search, close, next, back to top, and more. Buttons whose purpose cannot be recognised are left untouched. WCAG Criterion 4.1.2."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:442
msgid "Identify input purpose (autocomplete)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-backend.php:443
msgid "Adds the autocomplete attribute to form fields that collect information about the user - name, email, telephone, address, postcode, country - so browsers, password managers and personalisation tools can identify and fill them. Fields that already declare an autocomplete value, including autocomplete=\"off\", are never changed. WCAG Criterion 1.3.5."
msgstr ""

