#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1085
msgid "We provide accessibility training to all staff who create or manage web content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1086
msgid "We include accessibility requirements in our procurement and vendor evaluation process."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1087
msgid "We conduct periodic accessibility testing using automated tools and manual reviews."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1088
msgid "We have a formal process to handle and resolve accessibility complaints from users."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1146
msgid "All links that open in a new tab/window announce this to screen reader users via a hidden label."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1150
msgid "A skip navigation link is provided as the first element in the page, allowing keyboard users to jump directly to the main content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1154
msgid "Decorative images carry an explicit empty alt attribute so screen readers skip them rather than announcing the file name."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1158
msgid "A visible, high-contrast focus indicator is applied to all interactive elements for keyboard and switch access users."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1162
msgid "Navigation menus with sub-menus expose aria-haspopup and aria-expanded state to assistive technologies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1166
msgid "Content heading structure is validated on save to prevent level skips that disorient screen reader users navigating by heading."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1170
msgid "Icon and image links without visible text receive programmatic accessible labels so screen readers announce the link destination."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1174
msgid "Embedded iframes without a title attribute receive a programmatic title so screen readers can identify the embedded content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1178
msgid "Form inputs without a visible label receive programmatic labels so assistive technology users can identify each field."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1182
msgid "Icon-only buttons without visible text receive programmatic accessible labels so screen readers announce what the control does."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1186
msgid "Form fields collecting information about the user declare their purpose through the autocomplete attribute, so browsers and assistive technologies can identify and fill them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1190
msgid "WooCommerce quantity controls, product gallery, and cart notifications are enhanced with ARIA labels and live region announcements."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:1194
msgid "A pre-publish accessibility panel in the block editor alerts authors about heading skips, missing alt text, and unlabeled form fields before content goes live."
msgstr ""

